<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Lava Flow</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 11)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast lava flow &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast lava flow</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The first of the dark knight's fires: a flow of molten rock pours over the 
target. The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the more 
it burns. It does about as well against any armour, a little less against 
plate: a weak casting may do nothing at all to someone in plate. A shield 
can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting. 
It is also found on staffs, wands and scrolls. Stronger fires follow: 
hellfire, brimstone and soulfire.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hellfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Brimstone</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Soulfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>